                    <div class="text-group_4" justify-between>
                        <span class="text_13">江苏省2026年度考试录用公务员面试徐州考区面试通知书打印通知及考前提醒</span>
                        <span class="text_14">2026-03-10 15:32:07</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text_23">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                    </span>
                    <!-- 内容 -->
                    <div class="scroll-container" style="position: relative;left:0;height:40%; overflow: hidden;">
                        <div id="scrollContent" class="scroll-content">
                                <span id="download" class="paragraph_1">
                                    <p style="margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">江苏省</span>2026<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">年度考试录用公务员面试徐州考区将于</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">14</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日、</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日举行。徐州市人事考试中心提醒广大考生：</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:黑体">一、及时打印面试通知书，按时参加面试</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px">1<span style="font-family:方正楷体_GB2312">、面试通知书打印网址</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">考生于</span>3<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">11</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日－</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">13</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日登录报名网站（</span>http://218.3.167.180:8001<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">），网上缴纳面试费</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">用</span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">、自行打印面试通知书。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px">2<span style="font-family:方正楷体_GB2312">、面试日期、地点</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">面试日期为</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">3<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">14</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日、</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">日</span></span><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">考生按面试通知书上的具体日期、考点参加面试</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><table cellspacing="0" align="center"><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td width="268" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">考点名称</span></strong></p></td><td width="330" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">考点地址</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td width="268" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:19px">江苏省徐州市中等专业学校</span></p></td><td width="330" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:19px">徐州市云龙区两山口欣欣路东首</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;font-size:19px">号</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent: 43px"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:方正楷体_GB2312">、证件和时间要求</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">考生必须按照面试通知书规定的时间携带本人在有效期内身份证原件、面试通知书到指定的候考室报到，迟到</span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span></span><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">分钟以上者按缺考处理。考生通过抽签确定面试顺序。</span></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">候考室早上须落实相关准备工作，早到的考生不能即到即进。面试当天将安排考生统一于</span></strong><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">50</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">起进入候考区。建议考生考虑好路线和时间安排，</span></strong><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">前到达所在候考室，</span></strong><span style=";font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">8</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">00</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">未到作缺考处理。</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">二、管理要求</span></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">1<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">所有考生严禁携带任何通讯工具和电子产品（设备）进入候考（备考）室。已带入候考室的必须在组织抽签前主动上交给工作人员集中保管，否则按违规违纪处理，取消面试资格或面试成绩。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">考生一旦进入候考室候考、备考室备考直至面试结束，无特殊情况均不得无故放弃，否则将按有关规定进行处理，并记入个人诚信档案。所有集中保管的通讯工具和电子产品（设备）在面试结束后凭本人面试成绩通知单到手机发放处领取。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px">2<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">、面试考点采取封闭式管理，面试区域采取警戒管理。面试期间，非考生或面试工作人不得进入考点。尚未面试的考生一律在候考室等候，自觉服从工作人员的统一管理，耐心候考，不得与外界联系。候考室内禁止吸烟，候考期间考点统一提供午餐。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;text-indent:43px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 21px">三、考点地图</span></p><table cellspacing="0" width="663" align="center"><tbody><tr style="height:28px" class="firstRow"><td width="663" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">江苏省徐州市中等专业学校</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">↓</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:242px"><td width="663" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri;font-size:19px">&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src="https://xzhr.resource.cms.xztv.tv/resources/image/2026/03/10/782300671053893.png" class="art-body-img" width="637" height="305" style="width: 637px; height: 305px;" /></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><span style="font-family:Calibri;font-size:19px"></span><br/></p></td></tr><tr style="height:242px"><td width="663" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p><img src="https://xzhr.resource.cms.xztv.tv/resources/image/2026/03/10/782301083107397.png" class="art-body-img" width="634" height="297" style="width: 634px; height: 297px;" /></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><br/></p></td></tr><tr style="height:34px"><td width="663" valign="middle" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;" align="center"><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><span style="font-family:仿宋;color:#FF0000;font-weight:bold;font-size:27px"><a href="https://www.720yun.com/vr/49ajt7ewem4"><span style="font-family:仿宋">点击查看</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">VR</span><span style="font-family:仿宋">实景地图</span></a></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 19px">&nbsp;</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-align: center;"><br/></p><p style="text-indent: 43px; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px">2<span style="font-family:方正楷体_GB2312">、</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 方正楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">友情提醒</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">考生须提前熟悉考点地址和交通路线，规划好出行方式。考试当天务必在规定时间内到达候考室，以免影响考试。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><span style=";font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">面试当天早上</span>6<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">00—7</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">之间到达考点的人员、车辆较多，请送考人员勿进入考点，勿在附近聚集，迅速离开考点。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">打印</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 21px">面试通知书</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">后，请考生持续关注徐州人事考试网（</span>https://hrss.xz.gov.cn/rsks<span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312">），及时了解考试的最新动态，提前做好相关准备，以免影响考试。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312"><br/></span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px"><strong><span style="font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正仿宋_GB2312"><br/></span></span></strong></p><p style=";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;font-size: 21px">面试通知书打印入口</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:7px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:7px;margin-left:0;margin-top:auto;margin-bottom:auto;text-indent:0;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><a href="http://218.3.167.180:8001/"><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">==网上</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">打印</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">入口（电信）</span><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">==</span></span></span></strong></a></p><p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://36.154.82.46:8001/"><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">==网上</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">打印</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋_GBK;color: #FF0000;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">入口（移动）</span><span style="font-family:方正小标宋_GBK">==</span></span></span></strong></a></p><p><br/></p>
